Source: fmod
Maintainer: Crystal Durham <cad97@cad97.com>
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Description: FMOD Engine development package
 The FMOD Engine is a runtime library for playing adaptive audio in games.
 It consists of two APIs: FMOD Studio API, and the FMOD Core API.
 .
 The FMOD Core API allows audio programmers to create audio content without
 using FMOD Studio, and to interact with the FMOD Engine's underlying
 mechanisms. This makes it more powerful and flexible than the FMOD Studio API.
 .
 The FMOD Studio API can load and play .bank files created in FMOD Studio, an
 application that allows sound designers and composers to create adaptive audio
 content for games. This makes it less flexible than the FMOD Core API, but
 easier to use, especially for sound designers with limited audio programming
 experience and audio programmers with limited experience of sound design.
 .
 FMOD is not free software. Get a license: <https://www.fmod.com/licensing>
Homepage: https://www.fmod.com/
Section: non-free/libs
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Build-Depends-Arch: dh-exec (>= 0.29), patchelf
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/CAD97/fmod-engine-deb
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/CAD97/fmod-engine-deb.git

