Package: libfsbank15
Provides: libfsbank (= ${binary:Version})
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Homepage: https://www.fmod.com/studio
Section: non-free/devel
Depends: libfmod15 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libfsbvorbis (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: libopus-dev
Description: FMOD Sound Bank API
 While the FMOD Core API can play loose audio files in a variety of formats, it
 can also load and play .fsb files. .fsb files, also known as FMOD sound banks,
 are a container format optimized for loading and playing sounds in games.
 .
 FMOD is not free software. Get a license: <https://www.fmod.com/licensing>

